<title>UK: HSBC Holdings rises on technical.</title>
<headline>HSBC Holdings rises on technical.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in banking group HSBC Holdings Plc gained more than three percent on Tuesday as they recovered from sharp falls in the previous two sessions, dealers said.</p>
<p>HSBC shares jumped 68p to 21.65 stg by 0736 GMT in volume of 41,000 shares.</p>
